invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: PUBLIC stops naming the build record, so the link localizes
  ch_build_info_tcp_nonblocking and no consumer can read it. lib-check's export list
  reads PUBLIC, so the object and the list still agree and the export
  check passes. The consumer lib-check links against the object then
  finds no ch_build_info_tcp_nonblocking to read and fails to link, so lib-check
  objects. The link stamp holds PUBLIC, so the object is linked again
  under the edited list rather than kept from the last run.

--- old
PUBLIC_BUILD := ch_build
--- new
PUBLIC_BUILD :=
